    "created_at": "2016-03-01T09:02:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-01T09:02:30Z",
    "body": "Then I think it is mainly for short urls.\n\nNot sure about the adoption situation of `ping`, but I suppose websites may still want to use `href` for track url for backward compatibility (so that they can track old browsers as well without additional sniffing code).\n",
