    "created_at": "2016-03-01T12:47:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-01T12:47:52Z",
    "body": "`<a href=\"https://full/url\">https://short/url</a>` is that sufficient?\n\nI'm not a UI expert, but I think adding yet another thing that users can copy would mostly be confusing.\n",
