    "created_at": "2016-03-02T19:49:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-02T19:49:52Z",
    "body": "I tend to agree. Between `ping=\"\"` and the text content of the `<a>` element we have this covered. Maybe if we were starting from scratch we would use this kind of idea as a more progress-enhancement-friendly way of doing pings. But I am not sure it's worth it at this stage...\n",
