    "created_at": "2016-03-05T19:39:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-05T19:39:20Z",
    "body": "I suppose this proposal is rejected. If you can show that this use case is something many users would benefit from, or that a browser vendor wants to implement something like this, we can revisit.\n",
